[{"_1":2},"llms/mdx",{"_3":4},"data","# Firefox add-ons (/guides/install-firefox-add-ons)\n\nCrest does not install Firefox add-ons from **addons.mozilla.org**.\n\nExtensions in Crest for Mac run on the Chromium engine, which runs Chrome extensions from the Chrome Web Store. It cannot load a Firefox `.xpi` package. WebKit pages, and Crest on iPhone and iPad, run no extensions.\n\nMany Firefox add-ons also publish a Chrome version. Look for the same extension in the Chrome Web Store and install it from there. See [Install from the Chrome Web Store](/guides/install-chrome-web-store/).\n\nIf you installed Firefox add-ons in an earlier version of Crest, they do not carry over. Install each extension's Chrome version into the Space you want.\n"]
